; Breakage 03: Phantom-type trait violation — placing a `.draft` piece into a `|settled` slot!
; Schema declares: `|settled :piece @piece.accepted` -> `[ `Accepted ] piece_id`.
; Expected: `ocamlc` rejects `[ `Draft ]` where `[ `Accepted ]` is required at exact .ud line!

|document[broken-03]
  :context verisectorium

  |piece[p-root-def].draft Draft definition of «root»
    :kind    definition
    :author  "Claude-Fable-5.2"
    :version 1
    Still awaiting metadata attribute list.

  |outline[implementer-spec].deliverable For parser implementers
    :reader "Parser Implementers"
    |settled :piece @[p-root-def]
